data: {"id": "bf7e1e84eb1344a6-thinking-parallel_evidence-2058", "run_id": "bf7e1e84eb1344a6", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "好的，Topology 查询成功了。现在我已经有了足够的事实。让我总结本轮调查的结果：\n\n## 本轮调查事实总结\n\n### 已确认的事实（支持 ImagePullFailed 候选原因）\n\n1. **Pod 状态**：`aiops-case-02/workload-65b7f54794-rnlv4` 处于 **Pending** 阶段，`containerStatuses[0].reason = \"ImagePullBackOff\"`\n2. **事件证据**：kubelet 持续报 `Back-off pulling image \"registry.invalid/aiops/workload:missing\"`，已发生 284 次，跨度 65 分钟\n3. **日志证据**：`kubectl logs` 返回 `container \"app\" in pod \"workload-65b7f54794-rnlv4\" is waiting to start: trying and failing to pull image`——容器尚未启动，无应用日志\n4. **镜像配置**：`image=", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 6, "ts_ms": 1788413872873, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

